{"id":"dm-038","stemHtml":"<p>判断下列说法是否正确，错的要说明错在哪里：</p>\n<p>(1) 公理系统的可靠性是指：所有重言式都能在该系统中推导出来。</p>\n<p>(2) 公理系统的完备性是指：该系统中推导出来的公式都是重言式。</p>\n<p>(3) 演绎定理说：若 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>⊢</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\}\\vdash B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma\\vdash A\\to B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>(4) 公理系统内的每一条定理都必须用真值表验证过才能使用。</p>\n<p>(5) 罗素公理系统中的四条公理都是重言式。</p>\n<p>(6) 命题逻辑的公理系统是可判定的，即存在机械方法在有穷步内判定任一公式是否为定理。</p>\n<p>最后回答：为什么&quot;可靠性&quot;和&quot;完备性&quot;缺一不可？演绎定理反过来用是什么规则？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p>先把两个定义分清：完备性管&quot;该推的有没有推全&quot;，可靠性管&quot;不该推的有没有多推&quot;。记忆口诀：完备 = 推得够多，可靠 = 推得都对。</p>\n<p>(4) 想一想公理系统的推演方式：它只用符号变形规则，还是也要看真值？</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p>(1) 错。这是完备性的定义。可靠性说的是反方向：系统推出的都是重言式，不会推出非重言式。</p>\n<p>(2) 错。这是可靠性的定义。完备性说的是：所有重言式都能在系统中推出。</p>\n<p>(3) 对。这就是演绎定理的表述，它把&quot;带前提 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span> 能推出 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span>&quot;转化为&quot;能推出蕴含式 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\to B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span>&quot;。注意它是关于 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊢</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vdash</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span></span></span></span> 的元定理，不是系统内的一条公理。</p>\n<p>(4) 错。公理系统的推演是纯符号的：从公理出发，按代入、分离、置换等变形规则一步步变形，全程不涉及真值表。真值表是语义工具，只用来判断重言式或验证等值式，不属于公理系统的证明手段。</p>\n<p>(5) 对。公理本身就选自重言式（如 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(P\\lor P)\\to P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P\\to(P\\lor Q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 都是重言式），这也是可靠性能够成立的基础：从重言式出发、按保持重言性的规则推导，得到的定理全是重言式。</p>\n<p>(6) 对。命题逻辑是能行的：给定公式，可以用真值表或王浩算法这样的机械方法在有穷步内判定它是否为定理。谓词逻辑则没有这种一般方法。</p>\n<p>可靠性与完备性缺一不可：只有完备性没有可靠性，系统可能推出非重言式，这样的系统&quot;能证错的东西&quot;，不能用；只有可靠性没有完备性，系统虽然只证真命题，但很多重言式证不出来，作为逻辑系统太弱。两者合起来才保证&quot;定理集 = 重言式集&quot;。</p>\n<p>演绎定理反过来用：若 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma\\vdash A\\to B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma\\vdash A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma\\vdash B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span>。这正是分离规则（假言推理），它在公理系统里是被直接列为变形规则的。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<ul>\n<li>把完备性与可靠性两个定义对调，这是本章选择题最常见的失分点。</li>\n<li>认为演绎定理可以写成一条公理在系统内使用。它是元定理，写进系统就改变了系统。</li>\n<li>认为&quot;公理系统中的定理都要先验证是重言式&quot;。定理的合法性来自推演，重言性是由可靠性定理保证的一个性质，不是证明步骤。</li>\n<li>把可判定性和完备性混为一谈：完备性说的是定理是否覆盖所有重言式，可判定性说的是有没有机械判定算法。</li>\n</ul>\n","answerHtml":"<p>(1) 错（这是完备性）(2) 错（这是可靠性）(3) 对 (4) 错 (5) 对 (6) 对；可靠性与完备性缺一不可，演绎定理的逆用是分离规则</p>\n"}